cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fibonacci-vortex-core: φ-modulated vortex core with Fibonacci hierarchy"
abstract: >
  A vortex model with distance-dependent circulation:
  Γ(r) = Γ₀ · Σ F_k · φ^(−(k+1) r/r_c) / Σ F_k.
  Properties: Γ(0) = Γ₀ (exact), Γ(∞) = 0 (exact),
  Γ(φr)/Γ(r) ≈ 1/φ for K ≥ 5 (numerical). Includes pytest tests
  for all properties, comparison with Rankine and Lamb-Oseen
  models, and matplotlib visualisation. Research prototype (TRL 3).
